# SentimentAI — BACKEND TECHNICAL SCHEMA (PHASE 1)

## Overview

SentimentAI is an AI-powered investment intelligence platform focused initially on the Indian stock market (NSE & BSE).

The backend is designed around a simple principle:

**Fetch → Analyze → Cache → Serve**

Instead of generating AI analysis for every request, Athena intelligently caches market data, news, and AI-generated research to reduce API costs and improve response times.

---

# Backend Architecture

```text
Frontend (Astro 5)
        │
        ▼
Firebase Authentication
        │
        ▼
Firebase Cloud Functions
        │
        ├── Search Service
        ├── Market Data Service
        ├── News Intelligence Service
        ├── AI Analysis Service
        ├── Cache Service
        └── User Service
        │
        ▼
Firestore Database
        │
        ▼
External Providers

├── Yahoo Finance
├── NSE Data Sources
├── News Providers
├── OpenRouter
└── Future AI Providers
```

---

# Core Backend Philosophy

SentimentAI should never:

* Generate unnecessary AI calls
* Re-fetch the same news repeatedly
* Re-analyze the same company every request

SentimentAI should:

* Cache aggressively
* Reuse intelligence
* Refresh intelligently
* Reduce API costs

