# Standard AI Output Contract

Every AI provider must return:

```json
{
  "company": "",

  "outlook": "Bullish",

  "confidence": 82,

  "summary": "",

  "bullishFactors": [],

  "bearishFactors": [],

  "risks": [],

  "opportunities": [],

  "shortTermOutlook": "",

  "longTermOutlook": ""
}
```

Never return plain text.

Always return structured JSON.

